OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, a man who's been
OL,7,     Fexperiencing allergic reactions
OL,8,     Fisn't sure what's triggering them,
OL,9,     Fand an epilepsy sufferer is
OL,10,     Fdesperate to get his condition
OL,11,     Funder control.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FDuring a busy shift in Resus, a
OL,14,     F58-year-old woman arrives by
OL,15,     Fambulance with a dangerously fast
OL,16,     Fheart rate, and a patient comes in
OL,17,     Ffollowing a suspected drug
OL,18,     Foverdose.
