OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA man is rushed in to Majors
OL,7,     Fsuffering a collapsed lung as air
OL,8,     Fleaks into his chest cavity, a
OL,9,     Fhighly abusive patient must be
OL,10,     Frestrained, and a rough sleeper
OL,11,     Fcomes in with burnt feet.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA man's hand is caught in an
OL,14,     Findustrial machine, crushing it,
OL,15,     Fand threatening his life when it
OL,16,     Fproves impossible to get the
OL,17,     Fdevice to release.
